  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "You gather your things, ready to slip out into the cool morning air. The day feels heavy behind you already."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "selma-aydn",
      "text": "Wait."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "She rises quickly, smoothing her skirt with shaking hands. When she looks at you again, there's a rawness in her eyes that surprises you."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "selma-aydn",
      "text": "I... I didn't mean to take up so much of your time yesterday. But I couldn't help myself. You're the first person who hasn't treated me like a project or a problem since..."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Her voice trails off, throat working as she fights for composure."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "selma-aydn",
      "text": "I know this is none of your concern. But I wanted to say thank you. For listening. For seeing me, even when I'm being... difficult."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "She steps closer, the scent of rain and something floral filling your senses. Her gaze searches yours intently."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "selma-aydn",
      "text": "Will you... will you come by sometime? Not for work or anything like that. Just to talk. As friends."
    }
  ],
